- 2026-11-20 14:2x PST, thread 1567745029781454889 (Osama: "I liked how Tanks and IFV damage was before we removed the cover ... a % damage reduction for IFVs and
  etc across the board", "no no hook ... change all the values", "like tank cannon and autocannons"). DATA: section 2 of apply_0_9_4_dev1.py (batch now 14 checks).
