  10 -> 5.5, 30 mm HE 3 -> 1.65, 25 mm HEI-T 2.5 -> 1.375. AP/APFSDS/HEAT, ATGMs, MGs, AGLs and AA guns unchanged; no round is shared with other users, so no copies.
